  guideSlug: "jute-vs-sisal-rugs",
  guideTitle: "Jute vs Sisal Rugs: Softness, Staining and Where Each Fails",
  metaTitle: "Jute vs Sisal Rugs",
  metaDescription: "Jute is softer and sheds more; sisal is tougher and stiffer. Compare fiber feel, water staining, durability, seagrass and where each natural rug fails.",
